# Unbound exact-candidate map-connection crossing route (owner Thor battery copy; never saves).
# Masks: A=256 B=1 Start=8 Up=16 Down=32 Left=64 Right=128. mash = 1 pressed frame + 90 released.
# Same boot/Continue prefix and exit warp as unbound-location-grotto-warp.movie, then:
#  1. A on the water south of the arrival tile starts Surf (no prompt in this ROM); surf south and
#     west around the enclosed clearing, land on the plaza island of the same map (3, 6).
#  2. Walk north-west to the cave entrance at (10, 7); it is an arrow warp (walk onto it, then press
#     Up again) into map group 56 (the only group >= 36 reached): observed, then `restore`.
#  3. Start menu (icon bar, cursor defaults to the second icon; the first Right press after the menu
#     opens is ignored) -> Pokemon list -> first slot -> Fly (field move offered without an HM) ->
#     region map cursor Left x3, Down x2 -> A. Fly lands in city (3, 105) at (14, 10).
#  4. Hold Left along row 10: tile x=0 is still (3, 105); the step onto x=-1 crosses the west map
#     connection into (3, 104), where pos is rebased by that map's width (118).
# Run/walk speed in these outdoor maps is 8 frames per tile (auto-run); the grotto is 16.
run 600
run 600
mash 1 8
run 200
mash 1 256
run 300
